        "Content": "<ul><li>Most attractive red brick Victorian family home</li><li>Superbly positioned on the southern side of one of Irelands most exclusive and residential roads</li><li>Beautifully refurbished and dramatically reimagined interior under the architectural guidance </li><li>Two magnificent interconnecting reception rooms at hall level</li><li>Built in sound system throughout</li><li>Floor area approximately 465 sq.m. (5,005 sq.ft.)</li><li>Contemporary and comfortable Poggenpohl kitchen with high end appliances</li><li>Separate detached garage/gym to the rear accessed via Ailesbury Wood</li><li>Five generous bedrooms (3 en suite)</li><li>Wonderful period details throughout to include very fine marble mantelpieces, intricate cornice and centre ceiling roses</li><li>Wonderful blend of period and family living accommodation making this a most comfortable family home in which to live</li><li>Ample off street car parking to front and wonderful south facing landscaped garden</ul>"
